## ⚙️ NETWORKING & SECURITY
* **Safe-target guardrails** - block private IPs/onion by default  
* **PII minimization** - redact emails/phones  
* **User-agent contact field** - include contact URL/email  
* **GDPR/CCPA compliance** - `--do-not-store-html` mode  
* **Proxy pools** - rotating proxies with health checks  
* **Header rotation** - language/header rotation ethics-aware  

---

## 🧭 ETHICS & OPS
* **Auto-pause** on widespread 403/429s  
* **Do-not-crawl list** global + per-run override  
* **Kill-switch** - total bandwidth/request caps  

